Implementing RBAC in Grafana
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Grafana on a Linux system
Understand the fundamentals of Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) in Grafana
Create custom roles with specific permissions in Grafana
Assign roles to users and manage user access
Test and validate access controls for different user roles
Implement security best practices for Grafana deployments
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with web browsers and basic networking concepts
Understanding of user management concepts
Basic knowledge of monitoring and visualization tools
Familiarity with JSON configuration files
