Task 7: Advanced RBAC Configuration
Subtask 7.1: Create Custom Permissions
For more granular control, create custom permissions:

Navigate to Configuration > Access Control
Click Roles tab
Click New Role
Create a Dashboard Creator role:

Name: Dashboard Creator
Description: Can create and edit dashboards but not manage users
Permissions:
dashboards:create
dashboards:write
folders:create
folders:write
Subtask 7.2: Assign Custom Roles
Go to Configuration > Users
Select a user
In the Roles section, assign the custom role
Test the new permissions
Subtask 7.3: Configure API Access Control
Create API keys with limited permissions:

Navigate to Configuration > API Keys
Click New API Key
Create keys with different permission levels:
Read-only API Key: Viewer role
Dashboard API Key: Editor role
Admin API Key: Admin role
Test API access:

